{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Orbital Descent, a fast-paced maze challenge where every tilt of the maze can lead you to victory or send you spiraling off track. You're in charge of guiding a rolling ball through twists, turns, and  obstacles as the maze rotates beneath you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can discover hidden shortcuts and speedrun tech to cut your time or find all the coins to go for 100% completion. With simple controls, you can try to master the maze. Use checkpoints to reset to a safe point, but remove the timer, to practice the hardest parts of the level and master the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So jump in, pick your path, and see if you have what it takes to conquer Orbital Descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588530/extras/Clockwork_Turnip.jpg?t=1743202158\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588530?t=1743202158","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588530?t=1743202158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588530/07ab84b45391dd32100ef0abfd01de1baa560da9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743202158","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588530/07ab84b45391dd32100ef0abfd01de1baa560da9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743202158","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Orbital Descent, a fast-paced maze challenge where every tilt of the maze can lead you to victory or send you spiraling off track. You're in charge of guiding a rolling ball through twists, turns, and  obstacles as the maze rotates beneath you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can discover h